Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 19:14:38 +0800
Subject: media: histb-vpss: take packed 4:2:2 input


A YUYV or UYVY client had no way in, and the scaler's sampling fields
were fixed at 4:2:0, which read every 4:2:2 chroma plane at half height.
With exact luma a packed frame comes out with U and V exchanged.
Program the sampler and scaler sampling from the source and destination
layouts, describe a packed row as one plane of two bytes per pixel,
invert the chroma pair on output, and refuse a windowed packed frame
because the window registers' offset semantics are known only for the
planar layouts.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 87 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)


diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/histb-vpss.c b/drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/histb-vpss.c
index 1e1d3ebf678e..aba46d7fa67e 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/histb-vpss.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/histb-vpss.c
@@ -63,6 +63,7 @@ struct histb_vpss_fmt {
